ent-6991520465\n\n**Result: failed; pair ineligible.** The one pinned optional-runtime pair completed an ordinary child’s two seven-loader roots, three reads, 432 profiles, 1,152 fixed conditions and three native workers, then failed its unchanged list-versus-integer gate. The validated-share child never started. No retry, complete identity or savings claim. [Raw pair](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/research/validated-sharing-runtime-preflight/results/validated-sharing-runtime-preflight/failed-pair/manifest.json) was public at 9372a1c before the data-only report.\n\nThe source-check manifest at c5697ef listed an ignored Python 3.13 bytecode file absent from a normal clone. Both hosted report jobs in [CI #583](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/actions/runs/44414936420) failed four archive-authentication tests each. The [official failure logs](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/research/validated-sharing-runtime-preflight/results/validated-sharing-runtime-preflight/failed-report-ci/manifest.json) were published at f69e971. The [exact missing byte and repair receipt](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/research/validated-sharing-runtime-preflight/results/validated-sharing-runtime-preflight/source-check-repair.json) were published late at 97baaf2 without rewriting the historical manifest. This does not retroactively satisfy the pair’s source-publication gate; the raw manifest’s earlier publication flag is inaccurate.\n\nThe [corrected data-only report](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/research/validated-sharing-runtime-preflight/docs/validated-sharing-runtime-preflight-result.md) at e2825e3 checks Git history and marks source_archive_complete_at_pair_time=false and pair_admissible=false. Ten focused tamper/import tests pass in each locked runtime. All corrected-head local roles pass: base Python 3.11 and 3.12 each 5,626 passed/72 skipped/150 deselected, optional 72-file roles 2,532 and 2,531/one expected skip, Ruff, format, strict mypy (848 files), all-files hooks, clean guards and identical report rerenders. Fresh hosted [CI #586](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/actions/runs/44422838341) is running. Final evidence and merge remain pending.\n\nEarlier PR #92 missing-Numba pair, forecast, known-game accuracy and full-context-copy failures remain failed. No strategy or admission change.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-18T21:03:09Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T23:43:45Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"8c102441029f4896abae3035db79022ab0d740b1","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"jimmy-sim:research/validated-sharing-runtime-preflight","ref":"research/validated-sharing-runtime-preflight","repo":{"id":1444975151,"node_id":"R_kgDOViCSLw","name":"poker-ai","full_name":"jimmy-sim/poker-ai","owner":{"login":"jimmy-sim","id":77947780,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTQ3Nzgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77947780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim","html_url":"https://github.com/jimmy-sim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Personal poker AI research: simulation, CFR, reproducible Hold'em experi